{
  "case": "G030",
  "question": "按T/CECS 1764，采用特征因子法计算旱天入流入渗量BI的公式是什么？式中ADF、Cw、C、Cws含义是什么？",
  "expected_answerability": "answer",
  "request_id": "diagnostic-e2e-20261027-b6-r2-G030",
  "trace_missing": false,
  "wall_ms": 4741.301,
  "http_status": 200,
  "status": "answered",
  "answer": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "claim_id": "claim-1",
        "text": "按《城镇污水管网入流入渗监测与评估标准》T/CECS 1764-2024 第5.2.3条，采用特征因子法计算旱天入流入渗量的公式为：",
        "evidence_ids": [
          "chunk_496f23eb44f042f195ea5480a51eeb3b",
          "chunk_5b4a69b05c061dc1bb46adb48041e34e"
        ],
        "verified": true
      },
      {
        "claim_id": "claim-2",
        "text": "\n\nBI = ADF × (C_w - C) / (C_w - C_ws)\n\n式中各变量含义如下：\n- BI——旱天入流入渗量（m³/d）；\n- ADF——旱天日均流量监测值（m³/d）；\n- C_w——片区污水的典型污染物浓度监测值（kg/m³）；\n- C——监测点污染物浓度监测值（kg/m³）；\n- C_ws——片区外水的典型污染物浓度监测值（kg/m³）。",
        "evidence_ids": [
          "chunk_496f23eb44f042f195ea5480a51eeb3b",
          "chunk_e948cbce112e46206456a68b403b16de",
          "chunk_61bbdb6746f03e5dadc9520bb6157199",
          "chunk_69cf8b7c5fde928f9382e19cfaca12c8"
        ],
        "verified": true
      }
    ],
    "conflicts": []
  },
